// Grounded Brain: system architecture
// Eraser "Cloud Architecture" diagram-as-code. Paste into a new Cloud Architecture diagram at https://app.eraser.io
title Grounded Brain Notebook LLM: system architecture
direction right
colorMode bold
styleMode shadow
typeface clean

// ----- Client -----
Web Client [icon: monitor, color: gray, label: "Web client (AI SDK useChat)"]

// ----- API -----
Express API [icon: nodejs, color: green] {
  Middleware [icon: shield, label: "pino-http · CORS · rate limits · Better Auth · Zod"]
  Feature Routes [icon: git-branch, label: "workspaces · sources · chat · conversations · artifacts · memory · health"]
  Services [icon: settings, label: "Services (business logic)"]
  Repositories [icon: layers, label: "Repositories (Prisma · Pinecone · Mem0)"]
  OpenAI Queue [icon: list, label: "Shared OpenAI queue (p-queue)"]
  Inngest Endpoint [icon: zap, label: "/api/inngest (job functions)"]
}

// ----- Background jobs -----
Inngest [icon: zap, color: purple] {
  Event Bus [icon: radio, label: "Events: source/created · artifact/generate · conversation/summarize · source/deleted · workspace/deleted"]
  process-source [icon: file-text]
  generate-artifact [icon: book-open]
  summarize-conversation [icon: message-square]
}

// ----- Data -----
Data stores [color: blue] {
  PostgreSQL [icon: postgres, label: "PostgreSQL 16 (Docker locally) via Prisma"]
  Pinecone [icon: database, label: "Pinecone (vectors, namespace per workspace)"]
  Mem0 [icon: brain, label: "Mem0 (user memories)"]
  Cloudinary [icon: cloud, label: "Cloudinary (PDF files)"]
}

// ----- AI and external services -----
AI and external [color: orange] {
  OpenAI [icon: openai, label: "OpenAI: gpt-4o-mini / gpt-4o · text-embedding-3-small"]
  Tavily [icon: search, label: "Tavily (web search tool)"]
  Firecrawl [icon: globe, label: "Firecrawl (website → markdown)"]
  YouTube [icon: youtube, label: "YouTube transcripts"]
  Langfuse [icon: activity, label: "Langfuse (LLM tracing)"]
}

// ----- Connections -----
Web Client > Middleware: HTTPS + session cookie
Middleware > Feature Routes
Feature Routes > Services
Feature Routes > Web Client: streamed chat reply (SSE)
Services > Repositories
Repositories > PostgreSQL: Prisma
Repositories > Pinecone: upsert / query vectors
Repositories > Mem0: search / add memories
Services > Cloudinary: upload PDF
Services > OpenAI Queue: every LLM + embedding call
OpenAI Queue > OpenAI
Services > Tavily: web_search tool
Services > Firecrawl: scrape website
Services > YouTube: fetch transcript
Services > Event Bus: send event
Event Bus > Inngest Endpoint: invoke function (signed HTTP)
Inngest Endpoint > process-source
Inngest Endpoint > generate-artifact
Inngest Endpoint > summarize-conversation
process-source > Services
generate-artifact > Services
summarize-conversation > Services
Services --> Langfuse: OpenTelemetry spans
